# Level 2: the classifier rung, a custom action wired in as an input rail
# (Session 12's shape). `regex check input` (Level 1) and `self check input`
# (Level 3) are NeMo's built-in flows; config.yml switches them on and orders them.
#
# An action that raises does not let the input through: NeMo marks this rail
# stopped and replies "an internal error has occurred", which rails.py reports as
# `error:classifier check input`.

define subflow classifier check input
  $allowed = execute classify_input(text=$user_message)
  if not $allowed
    bot refuse to respond
    stop
